<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Macro: Boogie Woogie (Switcher — Jujutsu Shenanigans)

Objective: To simplify the process of activating the «Perfect Boogie Woogie» mechanics, which requires perfect precision when pressing buttons.

Process: The installed macro initiates the technique with a single keystroke, ensuring its consistent execution.

Prerequisites: You must support 120 FPS in the game on a public server, and also have a ping of no more than 100 ms. In addition, the character «Switcher» is used.

Important: The macro can only be active if there is no recovery time for all the character's abilities.
</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 21 1
Delay 115 ms
KeyUp 21 1
Delay 376 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 144 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 304 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>